   "word_start": 0.0,
   "speech_end": 5.98,
   "text": "Almost two thousand years ago, a glassmaker came to the palace of the Roman emperor Tiberius.",
   "first_word": "Almost",
   "asr_first": "Almost",
   "end": 6.46,
   "onset": 0.25
  },
  {
   "sentence": 2,
   "start": 6.46,
   "word_start": 6.46,
   "speech_end": 10.12,
   "text": "He brought a gift: a beautiful, crystal-clear glass bowl.",
   "first_word": "He",
   "asr_first": "He",
   "end": 10.55,
   "sil": [
    6.18,
    6.41
   ],
   "onset": 6.41
  },
  {
   "sentence": 3,
   "start": 10.55,
   "word_start": 10.58,
   "speech_end": 13.44,
   "text": "In front of the emperor, he threw it hard onto the floor.",
   "first_word": "In",
   "asr_first": "In",
   "end": 14.08,
   "sil": [
    10.22,
    10.61
   ],
   "onset": 10.61
  },
  {
   "sentence": 4,
   "start": 14.08,
   "word_start": 14.08,
   "speech_end": 16.82,
   "text": "The bowl did not shatter. It only dented, like metal.",
   "first_word": "The",
   "asr_first": "The",
   "end": 17.02,
   "sil": [
    13.64,
    14.14
   ],
   "onset": 14.14
  },
  {
   "sentence": 5,
   "start": 17.02,
   "word_start": 17.2,
   "speech_end": 20.48,
   "text": "The glassmaker took out a small hammer, and tapped it back into shape.",
   "first_word": "The",
   "asr_first": "The",
   "end": 20.95,
   "sil": [
    16.94,
    17.08
   ],
   "onset": 17.08
  },
  {
   "sentence": 6,
   "start": 20.95,
   "word_start": 20.94,
   "speech_end": 23.34,
   "text": "Tiberius asked him: does anyone else know this secret?",
   "first_word": "Tiberius",
   "asr_first": "Tiberius",
   "end": 23.86,
   "sil": [
    20.5,
    21.06
   ],
   "onset": 21.06
  },
  {
   "sentence": 7,
   "start": 23.86,
   "word_start": 23.74,
   "speech_end": 26.4,
   "text": "Proud, the glassmaker swore that no one else did.",
   "first_word": "Proud,",
   "asr_first": "Proud,",
   "end": 26.99,
   "sil": [
    23.41,
    23.92
   ],
   "onset": 23.92
  },
  {
   "sentence": 8,
   "start": 26.99,
   "word_start": 26.4,
   "speech_end": 30.46,
   "text": "But Tiberius feared this glass would make gold and silver worthless.",
   "first_word": "But",
   "asr_first": "But",
   "end": 30.94,
   "sil": [
    26.51,
    27.05
   ],
   "onset": 27.05
  },
  {
   "sentence": 9,
   "start": 30.94,
   "word_start": 30.94,
   "speech_end": 34.36,
   "text": "He ordered the glassmaker executed, and the secret died with him.",
   "first_word": "He",
   "asr_first": "He",
   "end": 34.75,
   "sil": [
    30.71,
    30.85
   ],
   "onset": 30.85
  },
  {
   "sentence": 10,
   "start": 34.75,
   "word_start": 34.78,
   "speech_end": 41.26,
   "text": "That's the story told by the Roman writers Pliny and Petronius. To this day, no one knows if this glass ever really existed.",
